## Why this license

The intent is simple: **take it, use it, change it, share it — just do not sell it.** A hobby
project, an internal tool, a free plugin for a free app: all fine. A paid product, a monetised
service, an ad-supported build: not fine. That is the whole of it; the sections above are only
the precision needed to make that sentence enforceable.
